00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:30.083
♫ We're Pretty Guardians

00:09:30.083 --> 00:09:31.518
♫ Such pretty guardians

00:09:31.518 --> 00:09:32.744
♫ In the name of the moon

00:09:32.744 --> 00:09:34.763
♫ We will punish you

00:09:34.763 --> 00:09:36.588
♫ We're Pretty Guardians

00:09:36.588 --> 00:09:38.289
♫ Such pretty guardians ♫

00:09:38.289 --> 00:09:41.896
(audience cheers)

00:09:42.844 --> 00:09:44.557
- Thank you Anime Expo!

00:09:44.557 --> 00:09:46.202
- Man, I am exhausted.

00:09:46.202 --> 00:09:47.929
- Oh, you guys, it was so much work.

00:09:47.929 --> 00:09:50.451
- My costume was falling apart all day.

00:09:50.451 --> 00:09:52.206
- Mine didn't fall apart,
but then I dropped my goggles

00:09:52.206 --> 00:09:53.237
in the urinal.

00:09:53.237 --> 00:09:55.382
- What's great about it,
is not one gives a shit.

00:09:55.382 --> 00:09:56.741
You really could just be wearing whatever

00:09:56.741 --> 00:09:57.910
and if you're like working it,

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:58.726
and you have a passion for it,

00:09:58.726 --> 00:10:00.327
someone out there is gonna appreciate it.

00:10:00.327 --> 00:10:02.244
- It's such a crazy energy
in this whole place.

00:10:02.244 --> 00:10:03.510
So sad we only came one day,

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:04.736
I would have gone the whole weekend!

00:10:04.736 --> 00:10:06.993
And oh my goodness, people got engaged!

00:10:06.993 --> 00:10:09.027
- Luxray has countered with a held item

00:10:09.027 --> 00:10:10.852
it's the destiny knot!

00:10:10.852 --> 00:10:12.458
- Will you marry me?

00:10:12.458 --> 00:10:14.422
(audience cheers)

00:10:14.422 --> 00:10:17.235
- It exemplified the spirit
of this whole weekend.

00:10:17.235 --> 00:10:18.643
People sharing their passions,

00:10:18.643 --> 00:10:20.621
sharing their love with each other.

00:10:20.621 --> 00:10:21.931
- I know I thought about love a lot,

00:10:21.931 --> 00:10:23.394
but I really wanna tell her about it,

00:10:23.394 --> 00:10:24.383
it's so cute!

00:10:24.383 --> 00:10:25.776
- What I've learned is
that I wanna cosplay

00:10:25.776 --> 00:10:26.667
more in the future.

00:10:26.667 --> 00:10:29.538
- All of us had just such
a great time, I get it.

00:10:29.538 --> 00:10:31.417
- I had a great time, this was fun.

00:10:31.417 --> 00:10:33.118
I like costumes.

00:10:33.118 --> 00:10:35.011
(laughs)

00:10:35.011 --> 00:10:36.237
- [All] In the name of the moon,

00:10:36.237 --> 00:10:39.901
what will we try next?

00:10:42.048 --> 00:10:44.709
- We stay here for a
year, no one will know

00:10:44.709 --> 00:10:46.351
we're using our costumes again.

00:10:48.846 --> 00:10:50.114
- We get to keep these, right?

00:10:50.114 --> 00:10:51.855
'Cause we made 'em.

00:10:51.855 --> 00:10:53.363
- Daddy likey.

